<%- include('../partials/layout-start') %>
<%- include('../partials/page-header', {
  icon: 'bi-calculator',
  heading: 'Tax optimisation',
  sub: 'An introduction to somebody qualified to advise you. Not a calculator.'
}) %>
<section class="glass-section pb-5">
<div class="container">
  <div class="row justify-content-center"><div class="col-lg-9">

    <div class="glass-card mb-4"><div class="card-body">
      <h2 class="h5 mb-3">What this is</h2>
      <p>
        How an SAP contractor should be set up — limited company, umbrella, freelance
        registration, a permanent role — depends on the country, the client, the length of the
        engagement and a dozen facts about you that this site does not know and should not ask.
      </p>
      <p class="mb-0">
        So the Hub does not compute anything here. A figure on a web page is a figure somebody
        acts on, and a site that cannot see your circumstances has no business producing one.
        What it can do is put you in touch with a person who can.
      </p>
    </div></div>

    <div class="row g-3 mb-4">
      <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="glass-card h-100"><div class="card-body">
          <span class="icon-tile icon-tile-sm icon-blue mb-2"><i class="bi bi-envelope"></i></span>
          <h3 class="h6 mb-1">1. Tell us where you work</h3>
          <p class="small text-muted-2 mb-0">
            Use the contact form and say you would like a tax introduction, with the country you
            work in and how you are engaged today.
          </p>
        </div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="glass-card h-100"><div class="card-body">
          <span class="icon-tile icon-tile-sm icon-navyblue mb-2"><i class="bi bi-person-check"></i></span>
          <h3 class="h6 mb-1">2. A person reads it</h3>
          <p class="small text-muted-2 mb-0">
            The message goes into the same queue every enquiry does, and somebody replies to the
            address you gave.
          </p>
        </div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="glass-card h-100"><div class="card-body">
          <span class="icon-tile icon-tile-sm icon-success mb-2"><i class="bi bi-chat-square-text"></i></span>
          <h3 class="h6 mb-1">3. The advice is theirs</h3>
          <p class="small text-muted-2 mb-0">
            Whatever you agree with the specialist is between you and them. The Hub is not a party
            to it and does not see it.
          </p>
        </div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">Ask for an introduction</a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline-primary" href="/rates">See the rate &amp; salary index</a>
    </div>

  </div></div>
</div>
</section>
<%- include('../partials/layout-end') %>
